hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"716","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab makkhi tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein gir jae to use chahiye ke use dubo de. Kyunke us ke ek par mein beemari hai aur doosre mein shifa (ilaaj) hai.'"
"717","[AI-translation] Muslim se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se khade ho kar peene ke bare mein poocha: aur log khade ho kar peete."
"718","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein sirf do cheezen — khajooren aur pani — hamara khana thin."
"719","[AI-translation] Dawud bin Farahij se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko is tarah bayan karte suna."
"720","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Ahle Suffah mein se tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamari taraf Ajwah khajooren bhejin, aur woh hamare samne rakhi gayin. Bhook ki wajah se ham do do khajooren ikathi khane lage. Jab ham mein se koi do khajooren jama karke khata to apne saathi se kahta: Main ne do khajooren jama ki hain, to tum bhi jama karo."
"721","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Islam laya jabke woh zyada khata tha. Jab woh Islam laya to woh kam khane laga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kafir saat anton mein khata hai, jabke momin ek ant mein khata hai.'"
"722","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Kafir saat anton mein khata hai, jabke momin ek ant mein khata hai.'"
"723","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kabhi khane mein aib nahin lagaya; agar Aap ko pasand aata to khate; aur agar napasand farmate to chhod dete."
"724","[AI-translation] Ja'dah ke aazad karda Abu Yahya se Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind riwayat hai."
"725","[AI-translation] Abul Ma'arik Bahjahimi se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se khade ho kar peene ke bare mein poocha. Unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tha; main apne hath mein oont ki lagaam pakde hue tha jabke Aap us par sawar the, mere paon us ke kandhon par the. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne peene ko manga aur use piya. Phir Aap ne use falan ko diya jo Aap ke dayen tha, aur Aap ne mujhe us jagah chhod diya. To agar tum mere baad mujh par doosron ko tarjeeh diye jate na dekho to use bura na samjho. Abul Ma'arik ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kahte suna: Jo qarz mein ho aur maal dar ho, phir ada na kare to woh us ki manind hai jo haraam khata hai."
"726","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo mitti khae, woh apne nafs ko halak karne mein madad karta hai.'"
"727","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Zaitun ka tel istemal karo aur use salan banao, kyunke woh mubarak hai.'"
"728","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi khae to use chahiye ke apne dayen hath se khae aur apne dayen hath se piye. Kyunke shaitan apne baen se khata hai aur apne baen se peeta hai.'"
"729","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Abdullah bin Umar se Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pichli hadees ki manind riwayat hai."
"730","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko bartan mein saat goh pesh kiye gae, aur un par ghee dala gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main is se parhez karta hun, to tum khao.'"
"731","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Ayyub (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare mehman thehre, to ham ne Aap ke liye khana taiyar kiya. Us mein ek (tez bu wali) sabzi thi. Jab ham ne use Aap ko pesh kiya to Aap ne use napasand farmaya aur farmaya: 'Khao, kyunke main tum mein se tum jaisa nahin hun. Mujhe khauf hai ke main (Jibreel Alaihissalam) ko takleef dun jo mere sath hain.'"
"732","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne (istemal se) tel lage bartan, kaddu se bane bartan, aur taarkol lage bartan se mana farmaya."
"733","[AI-translation] Abu Nadrah se riwayat hai ke ek aurat ne Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se poocha: Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye nabeez kaise taiyar ki? Unhon ne kaha: Ham Aap ke liye raat mein khajooren bhigoti thin, aur Aap use agli subah peete."
"734","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi khana khae to woh apna hath saaf na kare yahan tak ke use chaate ya chatwae.'"
